  "title-post": "How Hugo gains productivity with a simple QR code",
  "current-post-image-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/658bf26eb9062a377abfd888_Screenshot%202023-12-20%20at%2016.38.17.avif",
  "current-post-image-sizes": "100vw",
  "current-post-image-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/658bf26eb9062a377abfd888_Screenshot%202023-12-20%20at%2016.38.17-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/658bf26eb9062a377abfd888_Screenshot%202023-12-20%20at%2016.38.17.avif 1200w",
  "company-logo-style": "background-image:url(\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65941f340618964dca35e304_Group%2063.avif\")",
  "title-post-2": "How Hugo gains productivity with a simple QR code",
  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <figure style=\"padding-bottom:56.206088992974244%\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-video\">\n            <div>\n              <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mQ-LwHnpk7w\" title=\"GAIN IN PRODUCTIVITY (thanks to a QR code) | La Ménagerie du Roi x Innovorder\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>\n            </div>\n          </figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <p>Hugo, the founder of the Ménagerie du Roi, was looking for a way to simplify ordering at the table and save time on service.&nbsp;</p>\n          <h3>Flash, order, pay</h3>\n          <p>By implementing table ordering via QR code, he has made his customers 100% autonomous. Customers sit down at the table, scan the QR code, consult the menu, place their order and pay. And all from their smartphone.&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>The advantage of this solution is that it facilitates recommendations. Customers can re-order a drink or an extra board without having to wait for a waiter to be available.</p>\n          <blockquote><em>\"Click &amp; Serve allows me to increase my sales because it's easier for customers to recommend.\"&nbsp;</em></blockquote>\n          <h3>Productivity gains</h3>\n          <p>On the restaurateur's side, he no longer wastes time bringing in menus, taking orders and cashing up. He automatically receives all orders on his tablets or kitchen printers.&nbsp;</p>\n          <h3>The results</h3>\n          <p>Thanks to Innovorder Click &amp; Serve, :&nbsp;</p>\n          <ul role=\"list\">\n            <li>generates more orders thanks to recommendations,&nbsp;</li>\n            <li>it improves the customer experience, since customers no longer wait to recommend.</li>\n          </ul>\n          <p>-</p>\n          <p>Interested in installing this table-top ordering solution via QR code? <a href=\"/en/contact-us\">Contact an expert</a> for personalized advice!</p>\n          <p>👉 Discover our Innovorder <a href=\"/en/order-at-table-system\">Click &amp;</a> Serve solution</p>\n        ",
  "right-head": "The King's Menagerie",
  "bozzolo-cat": "Independent",
  "div-html": "\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/order-at-table-system\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65901ec70c1bc03529ae6d1c_Pictogrammes%20-%20_Commande%20-%C3%A0%20table.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65901ec70c1bc03529ae6d1c_Pictogrammes%20-%20_Commande%20-%C3%A0%20table-p-500.png 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/65901ec70c1bc03529ae6d1c_Pictogrammes%20-%20_Commande%20-%C3%A0%20table.avif 2084w\" class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Click &amp; Serve</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                  <div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/en/point-of-sales-restaurant\" class=\"solutions-block-item w-inline-block\">\n                      <img src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc596eea1a0225_Portefeuille-2.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt class=\"icon-solution\">\n                      <div>Cash register</div>\n                    </a></div>\n                ",
